<title>INDIA: India Brooke Bond H1 1996 net up 14 pct.</title>
<headline>India Brooke Bond H1 1996 net up 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		474.50 vs   414.70</p>
<p>    Net sales	    10,669.90 vs 9,886.70</p>
<p>    Other income	    433.20 vs   210.70</p>
<p>Total expenditure  10,132.20 vs 9,281.20</p>
<p>    Interest costs	  220.60 vs   119.00</p>
<p>    Gross Profit	    750.30 vs   697.20</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    125.80 vs    90.00</p>
<p>    Tax			 150.00 vs   192.50</p>
<p>Note : Brooke Bond Lipton India Ltd is one of India's leading tea companies. The results are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
